  "description": "For over four years, Shayla has served as the personal maid to Judith, the troublesome youngest daughter of the prestigious Kalley Count Family. Her predictable routine is completely upended when the heir to the estate, the eldest young master Cedric, returns home. Taking charge of his sister's chaotic education, he approaches Shayla with a shocking and archaic proposal: to become Judith's \"whipping maid,\" absorbing the physical punishments earned by the lady. \n\n *\"The duration will be three months. For your services, you will receive an additional salary equal to your current maid's wages.\"* \n\nThe offer of a double salary is too tempting to refuse; it means reaching her secretly guarded financial goal much faster. Greed overcomes her hesitation, and she accepts the contract. However, reality hits her brutally during their very first session when Cedric commands coldly: \"Lean against the fireplace and bare your backside.\" Only then does Shayla realize her grave mistake. She hadn't accepted a lucrative job, she had walked straight into his carefully laid trap. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
